<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility posts 9mo CZK 528mln gross.</title>
<headline>Czech utility posts 9mo CZK 528mln gross.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine month period ending September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		 527.750   vs    482.157</p>
<p> Operating profit	   535.729   vs    505.372</p>
<p> Output		     2,333.480   vs  2,071.950</p>
<p>Sales of own</p>
<p> goods and services     2,368.615   vs  2,062.810</p>
<p> Depreciation		 190.428   vs    173.892</p>
<p> Total assets	     5,300.840   vs  4,924.524</p>
<p> Basic capital	    2,507.542   vs  2,507.542</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name of the company is Moravskoslezske Teplarny a.s. It is an eastern Czech heating company. The data was provided by the company istelf. Its shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
